# Keep Docker build context lean (repo root is the build context).
.git
.github
.github_credentials
.gitignore
.cursor
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.nx
**/tmp
**/.angular
**/cypress/videos
**/cypress/screenshots

# Local tooling / docs not needed in image
*.md
!README.md
Makefile
.dockerignore
*.code-workspace
docs/

www/.env*
www/**/*.map
wasm/target
**/target
